  "details": "JeecgBoot through 3.9.5 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows any authenticated user to read MCP server configurations because the queryById permission check is commented out. Attackers can obtain record ids from the unguarded /airag/app/queryById endpoint and retrieve MCP endpoint URLs, headers, and outbound authentication tokens.",
